---
description: >-
  TB (top-to-bottom) oriented gitGraph with a develop branch off main and `showBranches: true`,
  verifying branch lines render correctly in the TB orientation.
config:
  gitGraph:
    showBranches: true
    showCommitLabel: true
    rotateCommitLabel: false
    parallelCommits: false
---
gitGraph TB:
  commit id: "1"
  commit id: "2"
  branch develop
  checkout develop
  commit id: "3"
  commit id: "4"
  checkout main
  commit id: "5"
